  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "淨零轉型",
    "sub_ename": "NET ZERO TRANSFORMATION",
    "describe_ch": "在經濟發展的必然性之下，邁向淨零的道路上，導致企業面臨巨大的衝擊與挑戰，淨零轉型與碳管理，扮演著關鍵的角色。對比過去，企業更加關注碳排放、碳中和及碳交易，以減輕風險更進而創造商機。然而如何做好淨零整合管理及轉型，並落實管理應對已到來的淨零轉型時代實為重要之課題。",
    "describe_eh": "Under the inevitability of economic development, on the road to net zero, enterprises are facing huge impacts and challenges. Net Zero, emission reduction, and carbon management play key roles. Compared with the past, enterprises pay more attention to carbon emissions, carbon neutrality and carbon trading to mitigate risks and create business opportunities. However, how to do a good job in integrated management, net zero transformation, and implement management to deal with the coming era of net zero carbon emission is an important issue",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
